    summary: "Yes, \"Stack Sans Notch\" is available as a Google Font. It is a sans-serif typeface with a modernist design and distinctive notched detailing, suitable for various uses including editorial, branding, and interfaces[1][2][3]. It offers multiple weights, providing flexibility for different typographic applications[3][4]. \"Stack Sans Notch\" is part of the broader \"Stack Sans\" family, which also includes \"Stack Sans Text\"[2][5].\n\nWhile there isn\'t a Google Font simply named \"Stack,\" another related font available is \"Short Stack\"[6]. All fonts in the Google Fonts catalog, including \"Stack Sans Notch,\" are free and open-source for both personal and commercial use[1][7].\n\nSources:\n[1] [kreativfont.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFbLzR8dszqrglP5oL5cG3YiUvKNneBCf1gvx685hgRMkQGqHGqQiy3ddzg4GReFkR5XvVo6idN5ERDZ5QJtH2sCsWbZTYIbGkR4L6B44wm_jV32YbQPPV_kaZ87waUiF9aGBxRviAS5RiffTbOSMmNlELaJhGf5oPhxz08)\n[2] [google.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQES2zoXG8LkgM-jq6n8NjROMZrGj6xcbs25Biewx7HtMSVRQoZFrwROA8tyC4hXMtwToDZhTGXRpUsJvvCo_vqGv4JV4fZFCkrzxS2Qp7c4OlP4aWsYsQAGBClCSMQg5eEC2fs8kAvHrDSzv6LL)\n[3] [fontpair.co](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHAAE_ISgdqntM4xsgJDNyRW5zksWZT9kzL5RqB6fQ009erT6gUb2P25eHAhGneN8bb0wKkS4oN408baD_8ux2P7c-cxWn_IhfDAWvLPCkAGXD_0dlTu4XVUzxMBwsz1qW4CU4Y9QDUxx8Q9kG6g_MZ)\n[4] [fontsource.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGtdoMS9C9FlQyWOqyA1ssmrjf3zsffuj6VRVGqyr-z0SKiCoqbzU1nUSphaKFOa4PhmbCaFUs9GwQodF9ni7Vf8exOBvXSCrH5oGAONmwYXheYqbtBVLan_pIi1h9MSemzXqqN7q2ScA==)\n[5] [google.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE_hwbNlWiw5rA6Bp0jUYGEyV726Ua0PeACDUxysGmDFZFmWcWfq7mhFbi2E7G663qggKWQCArZtaydF6rBSggmsGqR05k04-1cJ3_qH-QeYiVdGi0oKQTq_YOfOE25O2kKteeUlvUK0_eSs3U=)\n[6] [google.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirec