      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGm6qUfEaAHtwcy9HtobOgVmk63YZbEpnYqlr-Ome5jAIK0SPaAg74e9QL1-JzkIfkY5zKFpHzNllIVEjLbDAn5Lcgs86eQTmi0AxMucLKzcsCl7SxhFIdpiMkLOqUMYoqfu4JAPauXo5EIBqMsA-73a_PguMcrEp9hKZ7IeYCk6WwSXSiL"
      title: "controlaltachieve.com"
    }
    summary: "For those seeking \"Google Fonts\" that are \"sans notch,\" meaning clean and without distinctive decorative cut-outs or indentations, several popular sans-serif options are widely available:\n\n**Popular \"Sans Notch\" Google Fonts (Sans-Serif):**\n*   **Roboto:** Known for its modern and friendly personality, Roboto is a neo-grotesque sans-serif font that was originally developed as the Android operating system font. It offers excellent legibility and comes in various styles and weights, with extensive language support[1][2].\n*   **Open Sans:** A humanist sans-serif typeface designed for legibility across print, web, and mobile interfaces, Open Sans provides a neutral and friendly aesthetic. It is a versatile font, optimized for various uses[3][1].\n*   **Lato:** This humanist sans-serif font offers an elegant, classic, and harmonious personality, making it a popular choice for both digital and physical publications[1].\n*   **Noto Sans:** Aiming to cover all the world\'s scripts, Noto Sans provides a neutral and accessible tone with numerous weights and styles, and extensive multilingual support[4][1].\n*   **Work Sans:** Often chosen for its clean and easy-to-read sans-serif look, Work Sans is optimized for on-screen text at medium sizes, with extreme weights designed for display use[3][2].\n*   **Montserrat:** This popular geometric sans-serif font is also a frequently recommended choice for its clean and versatile nature[2][5].\n*   **Other highly-regarded sans-serif options** include Krub, Fahkwang, Sen, Inter, Quicksand, DM Sans, Lexend, IBM Plex Sans, Space Grotesk, Questrial, Epilogue, and Archivo[4][3][6][2][5].\n\nFor those looking for \"notched\" fonts, which feature distinct cut-outs or indentations as part of their design:\n\n**\"Notched\" Google Fonts:**\n*   **Nova Cut:** This Google Font was specifically created with cut-out shapes, initially for stone inscriptions, and later digitized. It is part of the Nova font family, which also includes NovaFlat, NovaOval, NovaRound, NovaSlim, and NovaSquare, each distinguished by the shape of its individual characters[7].\n*   **Danfo:** An experimental variable font available on Google Fonts, Danfo is inspired by the cut-out shapes of vinyl sticker lettering found on public transportation in Lagos, Nigeria[8].\n*   **Kablammo:** Also an experimental variable font, Kablammo draws inspiration from maximalist curly doodad designs and could be considered to have a \"notched\" or cut-out appearance due to its unique stylistic elements[8].\n*   **Sankofa Display:** This African typeface incorporates straight-line geometric designs, which may feature notched characteristics[8].\n\nSources:\n[1] [theflyingmuse.co](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF_gmA_8jb8W7486do0t9YMPPvBqMdZxSlcw-UPB-x2f_csV3NP9Kvqt96GPZeQTHEPnY2-q187hXO_fzO6hqyloP8y_eeDWkjDcS9idpdG63J937G2d_cBaj1_s1noFZ9AmfwR2RnOe_w1)\n[2] [typewolf.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQENvHOekmLfEaDGlZvjhhe1GM0vqZQzbH_twoX9lh_NeKS4U7tI-rsjtCBbQpFrOQ6Sy4qwZHoMPSbYZdOICHh8b9I_SO31B2r0nIWzDXAIvKjRw4-8LJ9YbRNvycSPWQ==)\n[3] [variablefonts.dev](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGUlG33Npbg5NXHACm_RCrhOMMnXJ7C7rtpIT4q5FdKet-QCnroUSaJfdTQO5h9fcA9hj8S_pViqWhnCv5QoON0NnTlDo9xmO2E9-DNlJ5nvNQHZWsaBcrUAbD-4EVfesLcDzbMaQXTh5dKwZs=)\n[4] [madebynf.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGN6ScdLCg9HSjdnPVSRKin0v6Es75sb__Jod-coOnGRdxsjTeQ98XARfMAqUkKAmfKonfGrvx0SgzSSTJbdyVYMrZexAS2F3yoPZCnuj0-z0T1QUZw8vTXDuWFQOBR8BYrjMFhS9DHHPUN-MjhbhTvXHtm6NuJA8Nh)\n[5] [jpkdesignco.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHuinUpWT4Y4MC8ze8VCThpcnCCWpeftgAG9-KhFYQfRGpuvkSj80UrvPebDm8guEwM2QFmdxR2sv8FBsaFD02IYfe-Ml_CoR87FRngGlQ7XcyYmTe8PZ5A_hRRf9xr0cR6cJgfs5CIUn_gyQ8KvFUn3w==)\n[6] [prototypr.io](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGgzFh6