  planner_response {
    modified_response: "I have updated **The Chronicle** to feature a distinctive tech-friendly layout, integrated side ad banners, and fully responsive mobile optimizations:\n\n### \360\237\216\250 Visual & Typographical Identity\n* **\"Stack Sans Notch\" Integration**: Configured a complete typographical architecture utilizing Google Fonts. We loaded **Space Grotesk** (celebrated for its sharp geometric angles and notches) and **Share Tech Mono** mapped under a custom family name `Stack Sans Notch` with a **JetBrains Mono** fallback for metadata lines.\n* **Tech-Minimal Theme**: Refined headers to include digital status indicators (`SYS.STATUS // CORRESPONDENCE ENGINE`), uppercase monospace captions, and crisp structural borders that give the blog a high-tech console editorial feeling.\n\n### \360\237\223\242 Side \"Image\" Ad Banners\n* **Desktop Sidelong Banners**: Implemented responsive, sticky left and right sidebar columns for viewports of `xl` width (1280px+). \n* **Themed Custom Graphic Banners**:\n  * **Left Sidebar Ad (`node_hosting`)**: Displays a high-contrast notched vector badge announcing \"NODE COMPUTE \'26\" with high-density hosting instructions and a clean \"LAUNCH INSTANCE\" action button.\n  * **Right Sidebar Ad (`meta_optimize`)**: Displays an abstract modern block detailing the \"SEO+ SCHEMA ENGINE\" to audit metadata.\n* **Layout Safeguards**: Fixed-ratio bounds on the graphic containers prevent any Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS), keeping performance high.\n\n### \360\237\223\261 Perfect Mobile Adaptability\n* **Adaptive Collapsing Viewports**: Side banners are hidden dynamically on mobile and tablet widths to keep the central grid completely readable, preventing layout congestion.\n* **Inline Mobile Sponsors**: Added an elegant, single-column horizontal card at the bottom of the article stream specifically for mobile users, keeping the blog fully responsive."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
