    summary: "A search on Google Fonts for \"Stack Sans\", \"Stack Sans Headline\", \"Stack\", or \"Notch\" yields the following:\n\n**Stack Sans Headline**\n\"Stack Sans Headline\" is a sans-serif font family available on Google Fonts. It is described as being rooted in modernist inspiration, aiming to balance timelessness and innovation. The font features distinctive notched detailing, which is inspired by the building process and serves as a unique signature for Stack Sans. It was specifically crafted for Stack Overflow and includes both a headline and a text style for diverse typographic expression. To contribute to the project, information is available on GitHub[1].\n\nIt is important to note that other search results for \"Stack\" or \"Notch\" led to different entities such as \"Stack\" by Adobe Fonts (a decorative font family by JTD)[2], STACK Infrastructure (a data center company)[3], Notch (a real-time graphics tool)[4], and STACK Construction Technologies (cloud-based construction software)[5]. These are not related to fonts on Google Fonts.\n\nSources:\n[1] [google.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGP1TYop9AgJDo_hmI91s3z2_dpufX1yt2Jkl-q4o-RMuQzAN7_Q6h5hSWhgEaWjv0Ta2Y9lvBsCLDgtujKnTwbV2h5J4lcNVlIONzn6ONm9TYCUc25IMlm7W8-MWCFBrBpRbE5RzuxeAfB2dQ1vwFc)\n[2] [adobe.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHkn9LdWRbjLYm2B0UcDYcP8FrRXZ_xD89CdZ5xeDOSNVo_VD4Ghdua5E3btkOjOm0IaBOi4CkFTx8uMVqDdzyh5rl2iX7RaOwgSm3DqJkJPWoNeKosUnFrG6E-t8iX)\n[3] [stackinfra.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGM961VWfOol8q2S4nP8Buq2fGqRdg1DExEp0L91ejRie2o25gvTyVHGWK1wc-0N5ueM6gAj1An284YuxtzK9m0H-koUavS1ZQQd3BkWnj247-9Xmlr2A==)\n[4] [notch.one](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG1Ej2_8Z2xq-8CG83Rp4Nn7Vq773ZmBz-VCP2wb_n35ACabrw0U5imxI_9oM_m4hUqwJPG0fSsv4E3nc5AtwXSZ1mDxRuTgLsykh-u_CMdHvA=)\n[5] [stackct.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com