      title: "typedump.com"
    }
    summary: "A search on Fontsource.org for \"Stack Sans Notch\" or \"stack-sans-notch\" reveals that Fontsource provides CDN hosting for the \"Stack Sans Notch\" variable font family. This font is a versatile sans-serif typeface with weights ranging from 200 to 700. It is free to use and easy to integrate into websites[1].\n\n\"Stack Sans Notch\" is described as a sans-serif font family with modernist inspiration, balancing timelessness and innovation. Its distinctive notched detailing, inspired by the building process, creates a unique signature. It was crafted for Stack Overflow and includes both headline and text styles[2]. The font is also available for free download for commercial use, preserving the original font files and including the OFL license[3]. It offers 6 variants and is suitable for various applications like headings, UI labels, and brand systems[3].\n\nOther resources also discuss \"Stack Sans Notch,\" such as Fontpair, which offers previews, pairings, and free downloads of the typeface[4]. Typedump also features \"Stack Sans Notch\" by Koto Studio, highlighting its \"notched cuts pushed to the foreground,\" turning geometric letterforms into something screen-native and crafted[5].\n\nSources:\n[1] [fontsource.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGamWegYWvUZe76psBOWvMLUfV7U9YMkoUDFW0RQLYZiUDW94gliX_5MgN3PQVLwQVyTLbDCZBFEC3KuTd58IeW6JmBTul1yMTaDBSG8B5sH8CX1XsHV684WLuCExAuEHJ5fVkL_p0s_SuxTA==)\n[2] [google.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE8ZoP7aWLPcsJ2t5_sc9BMajv-fbPiXdEr1LwfGJCsTh9qvj9F2rCOh2HPa9Wkpk8JKNylVRySMaVnoczmdEUSAbiM7lJZ15P9EZKPsivBIa4kUY7JqGwuiPQp1Zw1v7ndTCwZVldiQI5YiyA=)\n[3] [kreativfont.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGoMrQMQ3gALa4AOyfnjiESqENnYXFEPviS-Wg9KuAMdanrqgEUKdFlZtkYWUwqKsRGacrqsSwaVzrtg_2SGTP8F5VKz_Z0IYCBQDlcZo5QXj65pbrlEilvj5nVm-5cXlOCGWXPQNmKIOTYmESsTWgJRvU6XudGAFHpS1Y=)\n[4] [fontpair.co](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHQTL8fZnHnSRy8-lUXAwJ-BXBJvVO4Ow4zUUMy4Fi-jet6siBwwe9XotxGabTXHFaSsLPvehmxVDA-maq3lX85HYZ4OAMiT8eogIcYroVsLxUhgj3dLO5MSY-yC_VTKUI2Goo7Zopgusp2hDFuPM0=)\n[5] [typedump.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHlO3IwxzGm-lvGeSRKwGQeE80IENOBK7-9-BxXDlqGipHg3LFoKsDD1Hsj7OQ9nAch4HKR6Gl99tiGCQ93lWCI-6mSeP_vVgOFLOWdpnzvx45y4tqErPlbzubcuJ2cvOr2Q2ahdbd87A==)"
