          text: "[Skip to content](https://fontsource.org/fonts/stack-sans-notch/cdn#main-content)\n[Fontsource Logo](https://fontsource.org/)\n[Fonts](https://fontsource.org/)\n[Documentation](https://fontsource.org/docs)\n[Tools](https://fontsource.org/tools)\n[GitHub Icon](https://github.com/fontsource/fontsource)\n[Discord Icon](https://fontsource.org/discord)\n\n# Stack Sans Notch\n[Preview](https://fontsource.org/fonts/stack-sans-notch)\n[Install](https://fontsource.org/fonts/stack-sans-notch/install)\n[Download IconDownload](https://api.fontsource.org/v1/download/stack-sans-notch)\n[Globe IconCDN](https://fontsource.org/fonts/stack-sans-notch/cdn)\n\n# CDN\n[DocumentationExternal Icon](https://fontsource.org/docs/getting-started/cdn)\n\n### Subsets\n\n### Variants\n\n### Display\n\n### Copy CSS\nImport this into your global CSS file:\n\n```\n/* stack-sans-notch-latin-wght-normal */ @font-face { font-family: \'Stack Sans Notch Variable\'; font-style: normal; font-display: swap; font-weight: 200 700; src: url(https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/fontsource/fonts/stack-sans-notch:vf@latest/latin-wght-normal.woff2) format(\'woff2-variations\'); unicode-range: U+0000-00FF,U+0131,U+0152-0153,U+02BB-02BC,U+02C6,U+02DA,U+02DC,U+0304,U+0308,U+0329,U+2000-206F,U+20AC,U+2122,U+2191,U+2193,U+2212,U+2215,U+FEFF,U+FFFD; }\n```\n\n\n```\n/* stack-sans-notch-latin-wght-normal */ @font-face { font-family: \'Stack Sans Notch Variable\'; font-style: normal; font-display: swap; font-weight: 200 700; src: url(https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/fontsource/fonts/stack-sans-notch:vf@latest/latin-wght-normal.woff2) format(\'woff2-variations\'); unicode-range: U+0000-00FF,U+0131,U+0152-0153,U+02BB-02BC,U+02C6,U+02DA,U+02DC,U+0304,U+0308,U+0329,U+2000-206F,U+20AC,U+2122,U+2191,U+2193,U+2212,U+2215,U+FEFF,U+FFFD; }\n```\n\nFont Details\nCDN Hits: 4.47K\nLast Modified: 2025-11-04\n[GitHub IconGithub](https://github.com/fontsource/font-files/tree/main/fonts/google/stack-sans-notch)\n[NPM IconNPM](https://www.n