        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "### 2. Interaction to Next Paint (INP)"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "Replacing First Input Delay (FID), INP evaluates the overall responsiveness of a page to all user actions (clicks, taps, and keyboard events). A high INP feels sluggish and unresponsive."
