          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "excerpt: As mobile traffic dominates global usage, digital clutter is more than an eyesore\342\200\224it is a performance bottleneck. Learn how minimalist design boosts engagement and Core Web Vitals."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "excerpt: Too many buttons, menus, and pop-ups can make a website slow and hard to read. See how simple, clean designs make reading on your phone a joy."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "readTime: 3 min read"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "---"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "In the contemporary digital landscape, mobile interfaces represent the primary gateway for content consumption. Yet, a vast majority of web layouts are still burdened by the legacy of desktop interfaces: heavy multi-column grids, intrusive modal overlays, and bloated client-side scripts."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "**Minimalism is not merely an aesthetic choice; it is an optimization strategy.** "
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "When we strip away unnecessary visual noise, we achieve several major advantages:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "1. **Accelerated Visual Loading**: By minimizing elements, we reduce the DOM size, which directly speeds up the browser\'s paint cycle."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "2. **Simplified Reading Experience**: Single-column layouts naturally guide the human eye. There are no competing sidebars or flashing ads to distract the user from the primary content."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "3. **Optimized Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS)**: Text reflow is predictable and stable when there are no asynchronous, un-sized ad units or floating widgets."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "### The Single-Column Advantage"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "For mobile devices, a single-column layout aligns perfectly with natural vertical scrolling gestures. Users prefer to scroll continuously through a cohesive storyline rather than pinch-to-zoom or jump between disconnected layout blocks."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
