the correct URL and method for either new posts or edits based on `adminSubView`. I\'m using `POST` or `PUT`, setting the appropriate headers and body, and I plan to display the form status.\n\n\n**Adding Delete Functionality**\n\nI\'ve just implemented the `handleDeletePost` function, which now uses a `DELETE` request to the `/api/admin/posts/${id}` endpoint to remove a post. It handles confirmation and error states, with a `confirm` prompt for deletion. Upon successful deletion, I am now updating the local post list using `setPosts` and filtering to remove the deleted post and I\'m also preparing to add error handling.\n\n\n"
