enerate the .md file, including the date of creation.\n\n\n**Adding Post Updates**\n\nI\'ve just added the logic for editing dynamic blog posts via an administrative endpoint. I\'m focusing on updating the post\'s metadata and content. I\'ve built the validations to safeguard the input, and ensure safe file writing. The logic saves the updated data to the file system, handling potential errors to return appropriate responses.\n\n\n**Refining Post Updates**\n\nI\'ve just added validations for updated post content including the title, content, date, category, tags, author, excerpt, and readTime. I\'m ensuring all data is present before writing to the file, and handling the case where the post doesn\'t exist. I\'m taking the existing post\'s data for fields that aren\'t supplied in the request.\n\n\n"
