        lines {
          text: "---"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "Today, most of us read articles and browse stories on our phones. Yet, many websites are still designed for big desktop monitors, loading endless columns, annoying pop-ups, and complicated sidebar menus."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "**Keeping things simple is more than just making a site look pretty\342\200\224it makes it work much better.**"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "When we remove unnecessary visual clutter, we get three major benefits:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "1.  **Super-fast loading**: A page with fewer items loads much faster on slow cellular connections or older smartphones."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "2.  **Easy, distraction-free reading**: A single, clean column of text naturally guides your eyes. You won\'t get distracted by blinking ads or complicated side columns."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "3.  **No sudden text movement**: When there are no heavy dynamic widgets loading in the background, the text stays completely still, so you never lose your place."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "### The Power of One Column"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "On small phone screens, a single vertical column of text is perfect for scrolling with your thumb. Rather than constantly zooming in or jumping between disconnected boxes on the screen, a simple scrolling page feels totally natural and smooth."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "By putting readable letters and comfortable spacing first, reading a news article becomes peaceful and easy to understand."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
      }
    }
    instruction: "Add tags frontmatter heading to minimalist-design-benefits.md."
    replacement_infos {
      original_chunk {
        target_content: "category: Design\nauthor: Julian Drake"
        replacement_content: "category: Design\ntags: UX, Mobile, Minimalism\nauthor: Julian Drake"
      }
      num_matches: 1
    }
  }
}
